OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to deal with Troubles legacy
OL,4,Ato be debated in House of Commons
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne victims' group accused the
OL,7,Fgovernment of trying to take "control"
OL,8,Ffrom local courts but a veterans'
OL,9,Flawyer said that a judicial review
OL,10,Fcould be sought over any decision made
OL,11,Fby the attorney general.
